            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Der Klimawandel macht die Sommer immer heißer. Climate change is making the summers hotter and hotter."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "No plural. Das Klima — the climate — and der Wandel — change."
